00:12:09,150 --> 00:12:11,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>maybe I've become
too greedy since then.</b></font>

319
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:17,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>FIELD DAY</b></font>

320
00:12:17,910 --> 00:12:18,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[whistle blows]
-[students cheering]</b></font>

321
00:12:18,570 --> 00:12:19,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ANNOUNCER 11A]
Get ready!</b></font>

322
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:24,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Hachimitsu field day
officially begins now!</b></font>

323
00:12:24,450 --> 00:12:24,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>HACHIMITSU FESTIVAL</b></font>

324
00:12:24,790 --> 00:12:25,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gunfires]</b></font>

325
00:12:25,660 --> 00:12:27,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Attention all festival goers!</b></font>

326
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:29,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We found a lost child!</b></font>

327
00:12:29,710 --> 00:12:32,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you are missing a boy
in a blue hat named Sho,</b></font>

328
00:12:33,050 --> 00:12:34,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>come to the first-floor
entrance.</b></font>

329
00:12:35,010 --> 00:12:36,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gunfires]</b></font>

330
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:38,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

331
00:12:38,430 --> 00:12:40,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

332
00:12:41,010 --> 00:12:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

333
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:43,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

334
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
Uka, you drew all these?</b></font>

335
00:12:45,350 --> 00:12:46,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So cute!</b></font>

336
00:12:46,390 --> 00:12:47,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take a pic!</b></font>

337
00:12:48,390 --> 00:12:50,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait.
But why is yours blank?</b></font>

338
00:12:50,310 --> 00:12:52,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] She said it was no fun
drawing her own.</b></font>

339
00:12:52,310 --> 00:12:53,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] Hey, turn around.
Lemme see!</b></font>

340
00:12:53,690 --> 00:12:54,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
That sounds like her.</b></font>

341
00:12:54,860 --> 00:12:56,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YURU] I know you're happy
yours turned out cute,</b></font>

342
00:12:56,490 --> 00:12:57,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>right, Marin?</b></font>

343
00:12:57,570 --> 00:12:58,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

344
00:12:58,780 --> 00:13:01,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's not the kind of person
to ever hold a grudge,</b></font>

345
00:13:01,410 --> 00:13:02,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so you could stand to be nicer.</b></font>

346
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:04,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[grunts]
-[gasps]</b></font>

347
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quit being so freakin' nice!</b></font>

348
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:08,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

349
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:09,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Huh?</b></font>

350
00:13:09,210 --> 00:13:11,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAO] I'll be sure to give her
a piece of my mind pretty soon.</b></font>

351
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIRAISHI]
You rock, Tao!</b></font>

352
00:13:13,290 --> 00:13:15,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're our knight
in shining armor!</b></font>

353
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm. And there.</b></font>

354
00:13:17,590 --> 00:13:19,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Honey Lemon Soda?"</b></font>

355
00:13:19,590 --> 00:13:20,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SERINA]
That's sweet!</b></font>

356
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just like you!</b></font>

357
00:13:21,890 --> 00:13:23,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's with that bleach
blond hair?</b></font>

358
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:25,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Trying to be
the center of attention?</b></font>

359
00:13:25,510 --> 00:13:28,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nothing but a big ball of ego,
aren't ya, Miura?</b></font>

360
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:29,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

361
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:30,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
What's happening?</b></font>

362
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:33,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gunfires]
-So, then?</b></font>

363
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:34,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, we've gotta do something.</b></font>

364
00:13:35,070 --> 00:13:36,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you worry.</b></font>

365
00:13:36,190 --> 00:13:38,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just focus on yourself today.</b></font>

366
00:13:38,820 --> 00:13:39,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
The time we spent together</b></font>

367
00:13:39,990 --> 00:13:41,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>should be enough.</b></font>

368
00:13:41,740 --> 00:13:44,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But something feels off.</b></font>

369
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want to help him.</b></font>

370
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:49,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cheering]</b></font>

371
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:49,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gunfires]</b></font>

372
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:50,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"I"</b></font>

373
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:56,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

374
00:13:56,500 --> 00:13:57,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I get it.</b></font>

375
00:13:58,300 --> 00:14:02,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I lack confidence because
I get help more than I give it.</b></font>

376
00:14:02,590 --> 00:14:03,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
Are you okay, Uka?</b></font>

377
00:14:04,010 --> 00:14:05,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct students chatter]</b></font>

378
00:14:05,930 --> 00:14:07,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

379
00:14:07,260 --> 00:14:08,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh. Yeah.</b></font>

380
00:14:08,770 --> 00:14:11,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey!
Seen Kai?</b></font>

381
00:14:11,190 --> 00:14:12,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI]
He's not over here!</b></font>

382
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:15,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Probs asleep, bro!</b></font>

383
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU]
Well, he's running late!</b></font>

384
00:14:16,820 --> 00:14:18,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The cheer squad needs him!</b></font>

385
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:22,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] Hold on.
I'll look for him!</b></font>

386
00:14:22,700 --> 00:14:24,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RED TEAM 11A]
Uh-oh!</b></font>

387
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:29,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[slurps]</b></font>

388
00:14:29,450 --> 00:14:31,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Aw, ya gonna cry?</b></font>

389
00:14:31,460 --> 00:14:32,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you okay?</b></font>

390
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:34,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

391
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:35,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's head out.</b></font>

392
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait a sec!</b></font>

393
00:14:36,710 --> 00:14:38,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have any of you seen Miura?</b></font>

394
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:39,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scoffs]</b></font>

395
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:41,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RED TEAM 11B]
You're desperate. Chill.</b></font>

396
00:14:41,340 --> 00:14:43,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RED TEAM 11C] It sounds like
poor Miura's gone missing!</b></font>

397
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

398
00:14:45,140 --> 00:14:46,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I know that key.</b></font>

399
00:14:46,550 --> 00:14:48,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The storage room!</b></font>

400
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:49,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

401
00:14:49,970 --> 00:14:53,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

402
00:14:54,020 --> 00:14:56,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Miura!
Can you hear me?</b></font>

403
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, come on.</b></font>

404
00:14:57,690 --> 00:14:59,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought I told them
the lock was broken!</b></font>

405
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:01,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

406
00:15:03,860 --> 00:15:05,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door thuds]</b></font>

407
00:15:06,570 --> 00:15:08,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you there, Miu...?
[gasps]</b></font>

408
00:15:09,410 --> 00:15:12,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[flight whooshing]</b></font>

409
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[muffled groans]</b></font>

410
00:15:19,670 --> 00:15:21,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You found me this time.</b></font>

411
00:15:21,380 --> 00:15:22,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I owe you one.</b></font>

412
00:15:23,420 --> 00:15:24,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's annoying
how you can always tell</b></font>

413
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when something's wrong.</b></font>

414
00:15:26,890 --> 00:15:28,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA] I'll make sure
to always find you.</b></font>

415
00:15:29,050 --> 00:15:30,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
No matter what?</b></font>

416
00:15:30,430 --> 00:15:31,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
Yeah.</b></font>

417
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:33,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if I'm way up high?</b></font>

418
00:15:33,310 --> 00:15:35,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Like you were,
up on your balcony?</b></font>

419
00:15:35,310 --> 00:15:37,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll just sprout
some wings, eh?</b></font>

420
00:15:37,190 --> 00:15:38,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I figured you knew!</b></font>

421
00:15:39,270 --> 00:15:41,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've got wings of my very own.</b></font>

422
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look at the time!</b></font>

423
00:15:44,610 --> 00:15:45,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's go!</b></font>

424
00:15:45,780 --> 00:15:46,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

425
00:15:46,110 --> 00:15:46,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>THROB</b></font>

426
00:15:47,820 --> 00:15:49,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KAI]
You'll need those wings.</b></font>

427
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:50,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I'll be fine.</b></font>

428
00:15:51,290 --> 00:15:52,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Remember?</b></font>

429
00:15:52,830 --> 00:15:54,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The thing you said
after karaoke?</b></font>

430
00:15:55,750 --> 00:15:58,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are the protector,
and I'm the protected.</b></font>

431
00:15:59,040 --> 00:16:01,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But we can switch it up
now and then.</b></font>

432
00:16:03,130 --> 00:16:04,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can ask me for help.</b></font>

433
00:16:05,260 --> 00:16:06,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay?</b></font>

434
00:16:06,590 --> 00:16:08,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No matter how small it may be.</b></font>

435
00:16:10,550 --> 00:16:12,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My dreams are coming true.</b></font>

436
00:16:12,930 --> 00:16:15,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if they're selfish
and out of focus.</b></font>

437
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:17,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cheering]</b></font>

438
00:16:17,140 --> 00:16:18,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ANNOUNCER 11A]
You've waited long enough!</b></font>

439
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:22,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's get this started
with our all-star cheer squad!</b></font>

440
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:24,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

441
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:26,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Huh?
-How is he here?</b></font>

442
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:28,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gunfires]</b></font>

443
00:16:28,780 --> 00:16:31,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ANNOUNCER 11A] To all
inter-school relay contestants!</b></font>

444
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please gather now
at the entrance!</b></font>

445
00:16:32,580 --> 00:16:33,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I got such a good picture
of the boys!</b></font>

446
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:35,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They look so cool!</b></font>

447
00:16:35,290 --> 00:16:37,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It your fault
Miura's back in action?</b></font>

448
00:16:37,370 --> 00:16:39,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You shouldn't have done that.</b></font>

449
00:16:39,670 --> 00:16:40,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

450
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:42,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[RED TEAM 11A]
You know what?</b></font>

451
00:16:42,090 --> 00:16:44,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems like we can use
you to hurt him.</b></font>

452
00:16:44,630 --> 00:16:46,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He fought back against
us at first,</b></font>

453
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:48,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but gave up as soon
as we threatened</b></font>

454
00:16:48,380 --> 00:16:49,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to take you instead.</b></font>

455
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:53,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sounds like if we really
wanna mess with him,</b></font>

456
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:55,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you're the best way.</b></font>

457
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:57,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go ahead and try.</b></font>

458
00:16:57,390 --> 00:16:59,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just leave him out of it.
That'll be fine with me.</b></font>

459
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shut it.
You're not scared?</b></font>

460
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:02,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For real, girl.
Watch it.</b></font>

461
00:17:02,690 --> 00:17:04,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll hurt you.</b></font>

462
00:17:04,110 --> 00:17:05,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Go ahead.
It's okay.</b></font>

463
00:17:05,820 --> 00:17:06,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

464
00:17:08,150 --> 00:17:09,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

465
00:17:09,610 --> 00:17:10,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cheering]</b></font>

466
00:17:10,660 --> 00:17:12,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ANNOUNCER 11A] The red team
managed to pass the baton</b></font>

467
00:17:12,490 --> 00:17:13,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to number five!</b></font>

468
00:17:13,700 --> 00:17:15,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>White, blue,
and green are close behind!</b></font>

469
00:17:15,950 --> 00:17:17,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yellow brings up the rear!</b></font>

470
00:17:17,410 --> 00:17:19,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And they have Ishimori
on their team?</b></font>

471
00:17:19,620 --> 00:17:21,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are they actually
trying to win?</b></font>

472
00:17:21,420 --> 00:17:22,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who put her on the team?</b></font>

473
00:17:22,790 --> 00:17:24,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess we lost this.</b></font>

474
00:17:24,090 --> 00:17:25,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

475
00:17:25,590 --> 00:17:26,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka! Queen!
Uka! Queen!</b></font>

476
00:17:26,840 --> 00:17:28,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uka! Queen!
Uka! Queen!</b></font>

477
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:29,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Uka is my queen!
-[UKA] Thanks!</b></font>

478
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:31,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ANNOUNCER 11A]
The baton passes hands!</b></font>

