483
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:47,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ANNOUNCER 11A]
Look at her go!</b></font>

484
00:17:47,650 --> 00:17:48,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Yellow defies expectations...
