493
00:18:04,380 --> 00:18:07,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

494
00:18:15,550 --> 00:18:17,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
I want to protect him.</b></font>

495
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:20,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

496
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can do it.</b></font>

497
00:18:24,690 --> 00:18:25,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I will!</b></font>

498
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:30,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

499
00:18:31,530 --> 00:18:32,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I...</b></font>

500
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:35,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I...</b></font>

501
00:18:43,620 --> 00:18:45,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm hopelessly in love.</b></font>

502
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:46,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

503
00:18:46,840 --> 00:18:49,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

504
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:52,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ANNOUNCER 11A] Yellow's
catching up to red, bit by bit!</b></font>

505
00:18:52,420 --> 00:18:53,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And there!</b></font>

506
