513
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:07,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cheering]</b></font>

514
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:08,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

515
00:19:08,610 --> 00:19:10,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[screams]
