524
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cheering]</b></font>

525
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:33,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Uka?</b></font>

526
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:35,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If Kai ever liked another girl,</b></font>

527
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:37,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>do you think you'd be okay?</b></font>

528
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:41,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
