<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crying]</b></font>

531
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:46,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[UKA]
More than anything.</b></font>

532
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:47,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I'd say there's no reason</b></font>

533
00:19:48,060 --> 00:19:50,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to hold those feelings
