534
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:52,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now is the time.</b></font>

535
00:19:52,570 --> 00:19:53,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah?</b></font>

536
00:19:53,740 --> 00:19:54,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take the step.</b></font>

537
00:19:55,780 --> 00:19:57,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, Uka?</b></font>

538
00:19:57,110 --> 00:20:00,830
