00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:08,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

542
00:20:08,250 --> 00:20:09,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AYUMI] Right now?
